  historic Empress of China! CMAC was founded on the conviction that Chinat
 own has the agency to tell its own stories\, and the community stewardship
  of the Empress of China building (838 Grant Ave) marks a vital step forwa
 rd. Built in 1966\, this historic landmark has long held the collective me
 mories and celebrations of generations of local families. In 2026\, CMAC r
 eturned the building to community ownership\, and it is now evolving into 
 a space for creativity\, belonging\, and San Francisco’s future. Come ce
 lebrate\, experience art\, share stories\, and help shape Grant Avenue int
 o a vibrant cultural constellation. — Program Highlights — *Dream With
